#: ../../openmvcam/quickref.rst:4
msgid "OpenMV Boards"
msgstr "OpenMV 开发板"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref.rst:6
msgid ""
"OpenMV cameras and Arduino boards running OpenMV firmware. Each page has the"
" full pinout, peripheral mapping, supported drivers, and board-specific "
"notes."
msgstr ""
"运行 OpenMV 固件的 OpenMV 摄像头和 Arduino "
"开发板。每个页面都包含完整的引脚分布、外设映射、支持的驱动程序以及特定于开发板的说明。"

